/*
 * Detection basis: Sigma proc_creation_win_uac_bypass_fodhelper family (C1 overlaps);
 * MITRE T1548.002 DET0388/AN1094 (process-context half). Script-host signal.
 * Telemetry: Sysmon EID 1. Case-insensitive comparisons.
 * Boundary: building block - observes the script host itself; the fodhelper branch
 * overlaps C1 on the same event (the two alerts are NOT independent steps), and the
 * cmd-parent branch has lower specificity. Not a required PowerShell child.
 */
process where
  winlog.event_id : "1"
  and winlog.channel : "Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
  and process.name : ("wscript.exe", "cscript.exe")
  and process.parent.name : ("fodhelper.exe", "cmd.exe")